Package: mintcare-companion
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Linux Mint Community <support@linuxmint.com>
Depends: nodejs (>= 16.0.0) | node (>= 16.0.0)
Description: MintCare Companion - System Cleanup and Diagnostics
 MintCare Companion is a native system health, cleanup, fan curve management,
 and diagnostic utility built for Linux Mint and Ubuntu systems.
 Features hardware sensors monitoring, disk space cleaning, APT/Flatpak package
 management, and automated maintenance tasks.
